<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PRECISION DRILLING CUT.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PRECISION DRILLING CUT.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dillon Read said it downgraded Precision Drilling Corp to outperform from buy based on price.</p>
<p>-- said expects Precision Drilling to continue to benefit from its market reach in Canada and the record levels of Canadian drilling activity.</p>
<p>-- Precision Drilling gained 3/16 to 53-7/16.</p>
</text>
